UID:2026-11-19-seth-walker-the-talented-singer-songwriter-gu-28c9eb1@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261030T112712Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T190000
SUMMARY:Seth Walker The Talented Singer/Songwriter/Guitarist Returns!
DESCRIPTION:Seth Walker The Talented Singer/Songwriter/Guitarist Returns! Thu\, Nov 19\, 20 26 7:00pm Revered Americana artist Seth Walker returns to The Fallout Shelter with his Gospel-drenched\, Southern-inflected sound and a true blue knack for the guitar. Raised on a North Carolina commune by classically trained musicians\, he played cello for years before picking up the guitar in his 20s\, then let Austin\, New Orleans\, and Nashville shape the rest. Fresh off his new album Why The Worry\, he weaves blues\, R&B\nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875985/SETH-WALKER
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/875985/SETH-WALKER
END:VEVENT
