DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T220000
SUMMARY:New York City Shopping Trip
LOCATION:12/05/2026 05:30 AM - 10:00 PM Norwood Civic Center - Wall Room
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a day in New York City! We provide the transportation. A Coach bus with a bathroom on board. Saturday\, December 5th Depart: 5:30am from Civic Center to Central Park Return Departure: Central Park 6:00pm Sharp! **Don’t miss the bus\, it would be an expensive cab ride home! Movies are also included on the ride! **\nCost: $95.00 Res\, $100.00 Non-Res\nSource: https://norwoodma.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=30888
